sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant R as ForumRoute
  participant S as ForumService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>R: POST /forum/posts/:postId/comments
  R->>R: 校验 text/voice 互斥规则
  R->>S: createComment(userId, postId, dto)
  S->>DB: 校验用户信用分、帖子可见性
  S->>DB: 写 forum_comments
  S->>DB: 更新 forum_posts.comment_count
  S-->>R: 评论成功
  R-->>U: 201 Created
